{
  "_readme": [
    "Price table for every dollar figure in the extension. Edit, then rebuild: npm run install-ext.",
    "Prices are US dollars per million tokens. input = uncached input, output = output (thinking included),",
    "cacheRead = reading cached context. Cache writes are input x the multipliers below.",
    "A model id matches the longest name here that it starts with (claude-opus-5-5-20261001 -> claude-opus-5-5).",
